For physical measure data (house area, mound volume, etc.), use
\code{\link[=phys_pipeline]{phys_pipeline()}} instead -- it has its own dedicated pipeline rather
than a shared \code{data_type} switch, since the two kinds of data need
different columns and produce different summary statistics.
